OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day with
OL,6,Foccasional mostly light rain, but the
OL,7,Fodd heavier burst. Conditions will
OL,8,Fturn drier from the north later with
OL,9,Fsome sunshine developing.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloud and patchy rain in the
OL,12,Fsouth at first, but drier and clearer
OL,13,Fconditions across the north will
OL,14,Fspread to all areas through the
OL,15,Fevening.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,18,Fwith warm sunny spells, although the
OL,19,Fsunshine will occasionally turn hazy
OL,20,Fduring the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
